{"id":248814,"title":"结课测试｜这些接口测试知识你都掌握了吗？","content":"<p>你好，我是陈磊。</p><p>到这里，《接口测试入门课》这门课程已经全部结束了。我给你准备了一个结课小测试，来帮助你检验自己的学习效果。</p><p>这套测试题共有 10 道题目，包括7道单选题和3道多选题，满分 100 分，系统自动评分。</p><p>还等什么，点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=169&exam_id=390\"><img src=\"./images/248814_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":279495,"user_name":"天经地义","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1625579,"ip_address":"","ucode":"34C68844A0E729","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/cd/eb/ca154f0c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1613805606,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":103486,"content":"可以按照路线继续深入学习 ","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"陈磊@Criss","uid":1064280,"ctime":1616681297,"ip_address":"","comment_id":279495,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100045801,"comment_content":"学完了，了解些理论知识，不会操作工具的使用","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1064280,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/3d/58/377289a8.jpg","nickname":"陈磊@Criss","note":"","ucode":"AF0A1CEA749698","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":515755,"discussion_content":"可以按照路线继续深入学习 ","content_length":13,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1616681297,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398335,"user_name":"InfoQ_52adab8b3bc2","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1678125,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"BA22B2FDD4B8F9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/9b/2d/914cae47.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741078254,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146824,"content":"pytest 的 fixtures 是处理测试依赖的最好工具。它可以让你在测试前准备资源，测试后清理，并且可以控制作用域，避免每个用例都重复操作。这样可以将新建、删除放在各种异常编辑的接口之外，可能会好一些。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1064280,"ctime":1765181288,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":398335,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":100045801,"comment_content":"请教一个具体的问题：我们在单接口测试中做异常流覆盖，在业务流测试中关注数据能否跑通。\n那么，对一个编辑接口来说，他必然依赖新建，那么如何对编辑接口做异常流覆盖呢？\n我现在做的是用pytest的parametrize，每一个用例都做新建和删除，然后中间的编辑来做验证。\n还有其他更好的方式吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1064280,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/3d/58/377289a8.jpg","nickname":"陈磊@Criss","note":"","ucode":"AF0A1CEA749698","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":675345,"discussion_content":"pytest 的 fixtures 是处理测试依赖的最好工具。它可以让你在测试前准备资源，测试后清理，并且可以控制作用域，避免每个用例都重复操作。这样可以将新建、删除放在各种异常编辑的接口之外，可能会好一些。","content_length":278,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1765181289,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":347197,"user_name":"麥白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1264163,"ip_address":"","ucode":"058A631CA1A56B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/4a/23/6800a1b6.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1653811464,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146847,"content":"谢谢支持，加油","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1064280,"ctime":1765182206,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":347197,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100045801,"comment_content":"作为接口测试的入门课，值得一看，如果是纯新手，还是要多在工作中实践，长期积累，不然光了解意义不大。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1064280,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/3d/58/377289a8.jpg","nickname":"陈磊@Criss","note":"","ucode":"AF0A1CEA749698","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":675369,"discussion_content":"谢谢支持，加油","content_length":21,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1765182206,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":298587,"user_name":"Geek_88fb00","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2664707,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B4947576CF0E60","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/gDdDyl6Txc6ictXNfx39XdFzpREpiakc6JYZdK9L9WhuiaS7iaKjmeDOJsLQhLnVfXdQrN0diclE12a7CB2hfg1tjKQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1624205821,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146873,"content":"加密接口在券商、期货、银行项目里太常见了，基本跑不掉。遇到这种接口，测试代码里一般就这几招，记住这四步就永远不慌：\n\n1、先问开发要“加解密规则”或者直接要“测试用的加解密代码”\n2、把加解密逻辑封装成两个方法，放在项目里统一调用\n3、在api测试用例中统一调加密算法\n4、实战中最常见的几种加密模式：AES + Base64、RSA加密密码或sign、先RSA换AES key，再AES全程加密、SM2&#47;SM4、整个报文先加密再sign","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"作者","uid":1064280,"ctime":1765184315,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":298587,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100045801,"comment_content":"我之前的接口测试中遇到了加密的接口，这样的接口如何在代码中解密并进行测试\n","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1064280,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/3d/58/377289a8.jpg","nickname":"陈磊@Criss","note":"","ucode":"AF0A1CEA749698","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":675396,"